Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:30:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Test the atomic unit of permittivity against its definition 4
 pi eps0

- SI-history test: AtomicUnitOfPermittivity is exact up to CODATA 2014
  and not exact from CODATA 2018, like eps0.
- New test: its published value agrees with 4 pi eps0 in every release,
  so its exactness rests on the definition, not on that of eps0 alone.
- Test comment: values from 2018 on are "determined by the adjustment"
  rather than "measured".
- CHANGELOG: test list updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XHM6qC7Y8rv5syejamGbb9
